#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para><footnote><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:93
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Pre-built documentation is present in this tarball.  <command>make</command>"
" will detect that documentation already exists in the distribution if "
"<command>make clean</command> was not run, and will not require the <xref "
"linkend=\"xmlto\"/> dependency. However, running <command>make "
"clean</command> will result in the pre-built documentation being deleted, "
"thus requiring <command>xmlto</command> to build the documentation if "
"<command>make</command> is run afterwards."
msgstr ""
"A documentação pré construída está presente nesse tarball. "
"<command>make</command> detectará que a documentação já existe na "
"distribuição se <command>make clean</command> não foi executado e não "
"exigirá a dependência <xref linkend=\"xmlto\"/>. No entanto, executar "
"<command>make clean</command> resultará na documentação pré construída sendo"
" deletada, assim exigindo que <command>xmlto</command> construa a "
"documentação se <command>make</command> for executado posteriormente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:90
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"xmlto\"/> (required if you run <command>make</command> after"
" <command>make clean</command>)  <placeholder type=\"footnote\" id=\"0\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"xmlto\"/> (exigido se você executar <command>make</command> "
"depois de <command>make clean</command>)  <placeholder type=\"footnote\" "
"id=\"0\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of giflib"
msgstr "Instalação do giflib"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, prevent the build process from installing XML files instead of man "
"pages:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, evite que o processo de construção instale arquivos XML em vez de "
"páginas de manual:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:113
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../giflib-&giflib-"
"version;-upstream_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../giflib-&giflib-"
"version;-upstream_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:116
#, xml-text
msgid "Next, fix several security vulnerabilities in the 'gif2rgb' utility:"
msgstr ""
"Em seguida, corrija várias vulnerabilidades de segurança no utilitário "
"'gif2rgb':"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:119
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../giflib-&giflib-"
"version;-security_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../giflib-&giflib-"
"version;-security_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:122
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Next, remove an unnecessary dependency on <xref linkend=\"imagemagick\"/> by"
" moving a file into an expected location:"
msgstr ""
"Em seguida, remova uma dependência desnecessária de <xref "
"linkend=\"imagemagick\"/> movendo um arquivo para um local esperado:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:126
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">cp pic/gifgrid.gif doc/giflib-logo.gif</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">cp pic/gifgrid.gif doc/giflib-logo.gif</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>giflib</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>giflib</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:133
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:136
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:143
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make PREFIX=/usr install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"rm -fv /usr/lib/libgif.a &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"find doc \\( -name Makefile\\* -o -name \\*.1 \\\n"
"         -o -name \\*.xml \\) -exec rm -v {} \\; &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -dm755 /usr/share/doc/giflib-&giflib-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v -R doc/* /usr/share/doc/giflib-&giflib-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make PREFIX=/usr install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"rm -fv /usr/lib/libgif.a &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"find doc \\( -name Makefile\\* -o -name \\*.1 \\\n"
"        -o -name \\*.xml \\) -exec rm -v {} \\; &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -dm755 /usr/share/doc/giflib-&giflib-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v -R doc/* /usr/share/doc/giflib-&giflib-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:163
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:166
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>rm -fv /usr/lib/libgif.a</command>: This command removes a static "
"library which is not used by any BLFS package."
msgstr ""
"<command>rm -fv /usr/lib/libgif.a</command>: Esse comando remove uma "
"biblioteca estática que não é usada por nenhum pacote do BLFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:171
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>find doc ... -exec rm -v {} \\;</command>: This command removes "
"<filename>Makefiles</filename>, man and xml files from the documentation "
"directory that would otherwise be installed by the commands that follow."
msgstr ""
"<command>find doc ... -exec rm -v {} \\;</command>: Esse comando remove os "
"arquivos <filename>Makefiles</filename>, man e xml do diretório de "
"documentação que, de outra forma, seriam instalados pelos comandos a seguir."

